## description of what was run, for what purpose
Modal A100 smoke test of unified attention dispatcher with flash-attn 2.8.3 + torch 2.5.1+cu121 using modal_attention_flash_ampere.py to confirm backend selection and forward correctness on Ampere.

### command
source .venv/bin/activate && cd unsloth && modal run modal_attention_flash_ampere.py

### output (truncated)
caps Capabilities(has_flash_attn=True, has_xformers=False, has_flex=True, supports_sdpa=True, compute_capability=(8, 0), torch_version='2.5.1+cu121')
backend flash_attn_2
